      "description": "<h2 data-section-id=\"15bihhc\" data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"1018\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><span role=\"text\">Edwin Starr – <em data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1018\">Stronger Than You Think I Am</em></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1260\">Original U.S. pressing of <strong data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1063\">Edwin Starr's</strong> <em data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1094\">Stronger Than You Think I Am</em>, released on 20th Century Fox Records. Best known for his powerhouse soul vocals, Starr delivers a blend of funk, disco, and classic soul on this late-1970s release.</p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1bu1phi\" data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1280\">Tracks Include</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1434\">\n<li data-section-id=\"ntl92h\" data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1311\">\nStronger Than You Think I Am\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"6vb8wy\" data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1339\">\nNever Turn My Back on You\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"33g818\" data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1353\">\nTell-A-Star\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"178dto8\" data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1361\">\nSweet\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"aiwkct\" data-start=\"1362\" data-end=\"1378\">\nUpside of Down\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"nkmd8v\" data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1398\">\nBigger and Better\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"lxy6ws\" data-start=\"1399\" data-end=\"1417\">\nGet Up–Whirlpool\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"66udj1\" data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1434\">\nBoop Boop Song\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1515\">A great addition for collectors of classic soul, Motown, funk, and disco vinyl.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1520\">\n<h2 data-section-id=\"hrykuu\" data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1534\">Condition</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1574\"><strong data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1547\">Record:</strong> VG+ / EX (Visually Graded)</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1746\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1c1ava6\" data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1607\">\nClean, glossy playing surfaces\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"11c9feg\" data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1669\">\nMinimal light sleeve marks consistent with careful handling\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1q2ovrk\" data-start=\"1670\" data-end=\"1705\">\nNo significant scratches observed\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"au6kbo\" data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1746\">\nNot play tested unless otherwise noted\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1762\"><strong data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1758\">Cover:</strong> VG+</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1937\">\n<li data-section-id=\"15qpdu2\" data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1793\">\nClean front and back artwork\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"46odw8\" data-start=\"1794\" data-end=\"1822\">\nLight edge and corner wear\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1urt5j9\" data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"1854\">\nMinor shelf wear from storage\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1572fxl\" data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"1877\">\nNo major seam splits\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1mbs3ip\" data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1937\">\nPlease review all photos for the exact cosmetic condition\n</li>\n</ul>",
